    "turn_text": "There is no question that Hamas is a vicious terrorist organization. It's not the Palestinian people. The war is really conducting his against Hamas, not against the Palestinians because Hamas has committed again and again again to repeat its October 7 attack. Its goal is genocide to annihilate the Jewish people and eliminate the state of Israel. So making peace with Hamas, how does that happen? I think Netanyahu has a point. But at the same time, Netanyahu has to take steps to bring the hostages home to agree to this kind of pause in the fighting that will enable humanitarian relief and perhaps some greater peace and stability. but at the same time Israel must continue to defend itself against a terrorist organization that has one goal and only one goal which is to annihilate the Jewish people and the state of Israel.",
